    "harmful": 0
  },
  {
    "id": "p7",
    "text": "The line `..tally: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '/nonexistent.ledger'` in `make test` output is expected noise from an existing CLI test. The suite still passes (look for `OK`), so don't treat it as a failure.",
    "helpful": 1,
    "harmful": 0
  },
  {
